      <p>In OpenShift Container Platform 4.22, you can install a cluster on VMware vSphere infrastructure in a restricted network by creating an internal mirror of the installation release content.</p>
      <h2 id="prerequisites_installing-restricted-networks-installer-provisioned-vsphere" class="group scroll-mt-20">Prerequisites<a href="#prerequisites_installing-restricted-networks-installer-provisioned-vsphere" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
